    tmk:ordinal 19 ;
    tmk:text "(a) the opponent has established that the trade mark, or the trade mark with additions or alterations not substantially affecting its identity, was used in good faith by its registered owner in relation to those goods or services during that period; or" ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMA1995/s100(3)(a)" .

