    tmk:text "(a) goods of the same description as that of goods (registered goods) in respect of which the trade mark is registered; or" ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMA1995/s120(2)(a)" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s120(2)(b)> a tmk:LegislativeUnit ;
