    tmk:ordinal 2 ;
    tmk:text "(2) Regulations made under subsection (1) do not affect any trade mark that:" ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMA1995/s18(2)" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s18(2)(a)> a tmk:LegislativeUnit ;
