    tmk:ordinal 6 ;
    tmk:text "(3) In deciding whether or not to give its consent, the Commission must have regard to the matters provided for under the regulations." ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMA1995/s180A(3)" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s180A(4)> a tmk:LegislativeUnit ;
