    tmk:ordinal 4 ;
    tmk:text "(4) The exercise of a power or function of the Registrar by a Deputy Registrar does not prevent the exercise of the power or function by the Registrar." ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMA1995/s205(4)" .

