    tmk:ordinal 4 ;
    tmk:text "(4) The Registrar may, in a determination under subsection (1), specify that one or more means for filing a document with the Trade Marks Office are preferred means." ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMA1995/s213A(4)" .

