    tmk:ordinal 18 ;
    tmk:text "(a) subject to subsection 240(2) and subsection (5) of this section, the application is to be dealt with in accordance with this Act as if it were an application whose acceptance had been revoked under subsection 38(1);" ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMA1995/s241(4)(a)" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s241(4)(b)> a tmk:LegislativeUnit ;
