    tmk:ordinal 21 ;
    tmk:text "(ii) there is an opposition to the registration but the Registrar’s decision, or (in the case of an appeal against the Registrar’s decision) the decision on appeal, is that the trade mark should be registered;" ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMA1995/s241(4)(b)(ii)" .

