    tmk:upstreamRef "TMA1995/s26(1)~1" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s26(2)> a tmk:LegislativeUnit ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s26> ;
    tmk:authorityKind "law" ;
    tmk:capturedIn tmk:snapshot-c490a9927f1a ;
    tmk:contentHash "sha256:60fb7baea7268918a052213e1cc4fb6071f09b403f697c7961e9f40de651406e" ;
    tmk:ordinal 21 ;
    tmk:text "(2) If the authorised user brings an action for infringement of the trade mark, the authorised user must make the registered owner of the trade mark a defendant in the action. However, the registered owner is not liable for costs if he or she does not take part in the proceedings." ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMA1995/s26(2)" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s260(1)> a tmk:LegislativeUnit ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s260> ;
    tmk:authorityKind "law" ;
    tmk:capturedIn tmk:snapshot-c490a9927f1a ;
    tmk:contentHash "sha256:2adce92f1c80811ce0de687715eb400f9ac664449b6862655035c9cec1a047ec" ;
    tmk:ordinal 1 ;
    tmk:text "(1) If, immediately before 1 January 1996, the address for service of an applicant for the registration of a trade mark, or of an opponent to the registration, under subsection 132(1) or (2) of the repealed Act (existing address) was an address in Australia, that address remains the address for service of the applicant or opponent for the purposes of this Act until he or she notifies another address to the Registrar under section 215." ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMA1995/s260(1)" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s260(1)~1> a tmk:LegislativeUnit ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s260> ;
