    tmk:capturedIn tmk:snapshot-c490a9927f1a ;
    tmk:contentHash "sha256:a79635936f53f6dfbf3ce3b5118b199a3a60cf63ae74be8435901b3643c194b8" ;
    tmk:ordinal 4 ;
    tmk:text "(3) If, immediately before 1 January 1996, the proprietor of an existing registered mark had an agent in Australia for the purposes of subsection 70(1) of the repealed Act, the address of that agent is the address for service of the registered owner of the mark for the purposes of this Act until the registered owner notifies another address to the Registrar under section 215." ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMA1995/s260(3)" .

