    tmk:ordinal 13 ;
    tmk:text "(2A) Despite paragraph (2)(c), an application for registration of a collective trade mark need not be made by a person or persons having legal personality." ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMA1995/s27(2A)" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s27(2A)~1> a tmk:LegislativeUnit ;
