    tmk:ordinal 4 ;
    tmk:text "that person or that person’s successor in title may, when filing the application, or within the prescribed period after filing the application but before the application is accepted, claim a right of priority for the registration of the trade mark in respect of any or all of those goods and/or services in accordance with the regulations." ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMA1995/s29~1" .

