    tmk:ordinal 2 ;
    tmk:text "(2) If, after the prescribed period or the prescribed period as extended (as the case may be) has expired, the Registrar extends under section 224 the period within which the application may be accepted, the application:" ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMA1995/s37(2)" .

