    tmk:ordinal 11 ;
    tmk:text "(3) If an application is made under subsection (2), the Registrar must deal with the series applications that are the subject of the application under that subsection as if they were one application." ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMA1995/s51A(3)" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s51A~1> a tmk:LegislativeUnit ;
