    tmk:ordinal 11 ;
    tmk:text "(iii) to assign the trade mark to a body corporate for use by the body corporate in Australia;" ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMA1995/s92(4)(a)(iii)" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s92(4)(b)(i)> a tmk:LegislativeUnit ;
