    tmk:upstreamRef "TMA1995/s92(4)(v)" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s92(4)~1> a tmk:LegislativeUnit ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s92> ;
