    tmk:ordinal 3 ;
    tmk:text "(b) the Registrar reasonably believes that there are grounds for rejecting the IRDA under subsection 44(1) or (2) of the Act (as applied by regulation 17A.28) because of another trade mark:" ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMR1995/r17A.21(1)(b)" .

