    tmk:ordinal 17 ;
    tmk:text "(2) The Registrar may, on his or her own initiative, defer acceptance of the IRDA within the period mentioned in subregulation 17A.20(1), or (if such a period is extended under section 224 of the Act or subregulation 17A.20(4)) the extended period, if:" ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMR1995/r17A.21(2)" .

