    tmk:ordinal 2 ;
    tmk:text "(2) The priority date for a protected international trade mark in respect of particular goods or services is the date of effect of the protection of the trade mark in respect of those goods or services." ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMR1995/r17A.3(2)" .

