    tmk:ordinal 14 ;
    tmk:text "(d) if, after the end of the relevant period or that period as extended, the Registrar makes a decision to not revoke the acceptance of the IRDA—the trade mark that is the subject of the IRDA becomes a protected international trade mark when that decision is made." ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMR1995/r17A.36(d)" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r17A.36(d)~1> a tmk:LegislativeUnit ;
