    tmk:text "the trade mark becomes a protected international trade mark, to the extent permitted by the decision on the opposition, after the appeal has been dismissed or withdrawn." ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMR1995/r17A.36~5" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r17A.36~6> a tmk:LegislativeUnit ;
