    tmk:ordinal 8 ;
    tmk:text "(f) to a trade mark the registration of which has ceased is taken to be a reference to a protected international trade mark in relation to which the extension of protection in Australia has ceased." ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMR1995/r17A.39(2)(f)" .

