    tmk:ordinal 2 ;
    tmk:text "(2) For the purposes of subsections 95(2) and (3) of the Act, the application must be published in a computer database maintained by the Trade Marks Office." ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMR1995/r17A.48E(2)" .

