    tmk:ordinal 1 ;
    tmk:text "A notice of opposition is taken to be filed when the notice of intention to oppose and the statement of grounds and particulars have been filed under regulations 17A.48G and 17A.48J." ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMR1995/r17A.48F~1" .

