    tmk:ordinal 1 ;
    tmk:text "(1) The provisions of this Part, of the Act as applied by this Part, and sections 164 to 167 of the Act, apply in relation to a collective trade mark that is the subject of an IRDA or that is a protected international trade mark." ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMR1995/r17A.49(1)" .

