    tmk:ordinal 7 ;
    tmk:text "(d) despite subparagraph 17A.28(2)(a)(ii), a reference in section 41 of the Act to the applicant is taken to be a reference to the members of the association that is the holder of the relevant IRDA; and" ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMR1995/r17A.49(2)(d)" .

