    tmk:ordinal 11 ;
    tmk:text "(a) a reference in section 170 of the Act to another provision of the Act is taken to be a reference to that other provision as it is applied by this Part to a trade mark that is the subject of an IRDA or that is a protected international trade mark; and" ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMR1995/r17A.50(3)(a)" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r17A.50(3)(b)> a tmk:LegislativeUnit ;
