    tmk:text "(d) the transformation application is in relation to any of the goods and services to which the cancellation applies that were listed in the IRDA, or covered by the protected international trade mark, immediately before the cancellation." ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMR1995/r17A.51(d)" .

