    tmk:ordinal 5 ;
    tmk:text "(2) The date of effect of protection of the protected international trade mark in respect of particular goods or services that are covered by the registered trade mark and the protected international trade mark is taken to be the date of registration of the registered trade mark in respect of those particular goods or services." ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMR1995/r17A.54(2)" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r17A.54(3)> a tmk:LegislativeUnit ;
