    tmk:ordinal 6 ;
    tmk:text "(3) However, subregulation (2) does not apply if the date of registration of the registered trade mark in respect of those particular goods or services is later than the date of effect of the protection of the protected international trade mark under subregulation 17A.4(1) or (2)." ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMR1995/r17A.54(3)" .

