<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r21.21(1)> a tmk:LegislativeUnit ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r21.21> ;
