    tmk:ordinal 4 ;
    tmk:text "(c) to produce the evidence;" ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMR1995/r21.33(c)" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r21.33~1> a tmk:LegislativeUnit ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r21.33> ;
    tmk:authorityKind "law" ;
    tmk:capturedIn tmk:snapshot-c490a9927f1a ;
    tmk:contentHash "sha256:5adfc274b82ce8e72e4122a90d6762a42a7d835896afb43a8b21e27332aaece9" ;
    tmk:ordinal 1 ;
    tmk:text "If the Registrar reasonably believes that it is necessary for the proper conduct of proceedings for a person to perform an act, file a document or produce evidence that the person is not required by the Act or these regulations to perform, file or produce, the Registrar may by notification to the person require him or her:" ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMR1995/r21.33~1" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r21.33~2> a tmk:LegislativeUnit ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r21.33> ;
    tmk:authorityKind "law" ;
    tmk:capturedIn tmk:snapshot-c490a9927f1a ;
    tmk:contentHash "sha256:e3dc3751ef9e2d183c85f1306f4860c4a86db7b39e89a3bcdedd083d3bf97a45" ;
    tmk:ordinal 5 ;
    tmk:text "that is specified in the notification." ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMR1995/r21.33~2" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r21.4(1)> a tmk:LegislativeUnit ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r21.4> ;
    tmk:authorityKind "law" ;
    tmk:capturedIn tmk:snapshot-c490a9927f1a ;
    tmk:contentHash "sha256:2502bd6d1d76ce9fe71ddf012c276bdfcebcebb7cf75cb5837fac301365e36c5" ;
    tmk:ordinal 1 ;
    tmk:text "(1) If a document received for filing at the Trade Marks Office does not comply with the Act or the regulations, or is not in accordance with whichever approved form is applicable, the Registrar may treat the document:" ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMR1995/r21.4(1)" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r21.4(1)(a)> a tmk:LegislativeUnit ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r21.4> ;
    tmk:authorityKind "law" ;
    tmk:capturedIn tmk:snapshot-c490a9927f1a ;
    tmk:contentHash "sha256:55e2076aeaf5b250790b82a2dbcd00c1519a6f052559634e5fd0d8c48ec3ae43" ;
    tmk:ordinal 2 ;
    tmk:text "(a) as not having been filed and notify the person, including in the notification a statement indicating how the document does not comply with the Act or the regulations or is not in accordance with the approved form; or" ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMR1995/r21.4(1)(a)" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r21.4(1)(b)> a tmk:LegislativeUnit ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r21.4> ;
    tmk:authorityKind "law" ;
    tmk:capturedIn tmk:snapshot-c490a9927f1a ;
    tmk:contentHash "sha256:9563a3d52bd26b2078e106df6acb25e629bfa5abb3cb98e94cb562feb52b9232" ;
    tmk:ordinal 3 ;
    tmk:text "(b) as having been filed, but direct the person to do such things as are necessary to ensure that the document does comply with the Act or the regulations or is in accordance with the approved form." ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMR1995/r21.4(1)(b)" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r21.4(1)(b)~1> a tmk:LegislativeUnit ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r21.4> ;
    tmk:authorityKind "law" ;
    tmk:capturedIn tmk:snapshot-c490a9927f1a ;
    tmk:contentHash "sha256:492cef45b192fa2840a759cd21c6f3492b8c90af3bbd3075ad933281d2167940" ;
    tmk:ordinal 4 ;
    tmk:text "Note: Regulations 4.2 and 4.2A set out requirements with which applications for the registration of trade marks must comply to be taken as having been filed." ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMR1995/r21.4(1)(b)~1" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r21.4(2)> a tmk:LegislativeUnit ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r21.4> ;
    tmk:authorityKind "law" ;
    tmk:capturedIn tmk:snapshot-c490a9927f1a ;
    tmk:contentHash "sha256:9bad88dc7668d8f331664f8aacd221a1e7b6c732131f37b49ec6c475f923a0ad" ;
    tmk:ordinal 5 ;
    tmk:text "(2) If the Registrar gives a direction under paragraph (1)(b) and the person does not comply with the direction within the period specified in the direction, the Registrar may treat the document as not having been filed." ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMR1995/r21.4(2)" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r21.5(1)> a tmk:LegislativeUnit ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r21.5> ;
    tmk:authorityKind "law" ;
    tmk:capturedIn tmk:snapshot-c490a9927f1a ;
    tmk:contentHash "sha256:d1502b0c1009e222810044691d8e547a6c8718c2ba2ddd91560b64f3f2748139" ;
    tmk:ordinal 1 ;
    tmk:text "(1) A document that is received for filing must be marked by the Registrar with the date on which it is received." ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMR1995/r21.5(1)" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r21.5(2)> a tmk:LegislativeUnit ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r21.5> ;
    tmk:authorityKind "law" ;
    tmk:capturedIn tmk:snapshot-c490a9927f1a ;
    tmk:contentHash "sha256:fee4da3bb94815032f9839a60eabefac3921ead171adca1d2be2d450d8d0d4fe" ;
    tmk:ordinal 2 ;
    tmk:text "(2) If the Trade Marks Office or a suboffice (if any) provides a facility for the receipt of documents (other than documents filed electronically), when the Trade Marks Office or suboffice (if any) is not open to the public for business, a document received by means of that facility is taken to have been received on the day on which the Trade Marks Office or suboffice (if any) was last open to the public for business before the document was received." ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMR1995/r21.5(2)" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r21.5(3)> a tmk:LegislativeUnit ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r21.5> ;
    tmk:authorityKind "law" ;
    tmk:capturedIn tmk:snapshot-c490a9927f1a ;
    tmk:contentHash "sha256:7c1bb7ec1a15da412f188dedc860cdca9c90ba55f945a73f28762d723621ed91" ;
    tmk:ordinal 3 ;
    tmk:text "(3) Except as otherwise provided by the Act or these regulations, a document is taken to be filed at the Trade Marks Office on the date on which it is received by the Trade Marks Office." ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMR1995/r21.5(3)" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r21.6(1)> a tmk:LegislativeUnit ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r21.6> ;
    tmk:authorityKind "law" ;
    tmk:capturedIn tmk:snapshot-c490a9927f1a ;
    tmk:contentHash "sha256:9104253467f86e081b70295bbdf2a182eced83e013555d0c8f1f4b9a0d2edfb1" ;
    tmk:ordinal 1 ;
    tmk:text "(1) A declaration required or permitted by the Act or these Regulations must be in an approved form." ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMR1995/r21.6(1)" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r21.6(1)~1> a tmk:LegislativeUnit ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r21.6> ;
    tmk:authorityKind "law" ;
    tmk:capturedIn tmk:snapshot-c490a9927f1a ;
    tmk:contentHash "sha256:282cd5dc450280cadab8b2c008c9aae292092934761220563279792e9c3d6381" ;
    tmk:ordinal 2 ;
    tmk:text "Note: Declaration forms in the approved form are available on the IP Australia website at www.ipaustralia.gov.au." ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMR1995/r21.6(1)~1" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r21.6(2)> a tmk:LegislativeUnit ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r21.6> ;
    tmk:authorityKind "law" ;
    tmk:capturedIn tmk:snapshot-c490a9927f1a ;
    tmk:contentHash "sha256:91e2c68a49f7a9935519029829afe2a1696e603d218e603a718be6012199c20f" ;
    tmk:ordinal 3 ;
    tmk:text "(2) A declaration in the form of a statutory declaration, required or permitted to be given to a person mentioned in subregulation (3), may be given to the person in an electronic form by a means of electronic communication approved by the Registrar." ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMR1995/r21.6(2)" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r21.6(2)~1> a tmk:LegislativeUnit ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r21.6> ;
    tmk:authorityKind "law" ;
    tmk:capturedIn tmk:snapshot-c490a9927f1a ;
    tmk:contentHash "sha256:8be12ea689e8458a62e1bf4e10e16175e450fcd1a2edae41403bde6814a74ea6" ;
    tmk:ordinal 4 ;
    tmk:text "Note: A declaration that is not in the form of statutory declaration may also be given in an electronic form by means of an electronic communication: see section 11 of the Electronic Transactions Act 1999." ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMR1995/r21.6(2)~1" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r21.6(3)> a tmk:LegislativeUnit ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r21.6> ;
