    tmk:ordinal 5 ;
    tmk:text "(2) The fee payable for the registration of a trade mark of a kind mentioned in subsection 241(2) of the Act is the fee that was payable under regulations made under the Trade Marks Act 1955, being the regulations as in force when the application was accepted." ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMR1995/r22.2(2)" .

