    tmk:ordinal 6 ;
    tmk:text "(3) Unless acceptance of an application is deferred, a report under subregulation (2) in relation to that application must include notification of the date on which the application will lapse if it is not accepted earlier." ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMR1995/r4.10(3)" .

