    tmk:ordinal 1 ;
    tmk:text "(1) In the course of an examination of an application for which a right of priority is claimed, the Registrar may notify the applicant that the applicant is required to file:" ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMR1995/r4.11(1)" .

