    tmk:ordinal 1 ;
    tmk:text "(1) For subsection 52A(2) of the Act, a notice of intention to defend must be filed within 2 months from the day the applicant is given a copy of the statement of grounds and particulars." ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMR1995/r5.13(1)" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r5.13(2)> a tmk:LegislativeUnit ;
