    tmk:ordinal 1 ;
    tmk:text "(1) For subsection 95(1) of the Act, the Registrar must, within one month from the filing of the application, give a copy of the application to each person who, in the Registrar’s opinion, should receive one." ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMR1995/r9.6(1)" .

