    tmk:text "(1) Subject to this Part, the provisions of this Act relating to trade marks (other than Part 10—Assignment and Transmission of Trade Marks) apply to collective trade marks and so apply as if:" ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMA1995/s163(1)" .

