    tmk:ordinal 1 ;
    tmk:text "(1) The regulations may provide that a sign specified in the regulations is not to be used as a trade mark or as part of a trade mark." ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMA1995/s18(1)" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s180(1)> a tmk:LegislativeUnit ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/doc/TMA1995>,
        <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s180> ;
    tmk:authorityKind "law" ;
    tmk:authorityStatus tmk:Current ;
    tmk:capturedIn tmk:snapshot-c490a9927f1a ;
    tmk:contentHash "sha256:dc3ddaff80611ceeb63a6d74c1ce848cb91221435da2009ad2712e5c1af073a5" ;
    tmk:ordinal 1 ;
    tmk:text "(1) A registered certification trade mark may be assigned only with the consent of the Commission." ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMA1995/s180(1)" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s180(2)> a tmk:LegislativeUnit ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/doc/TMA1995>,
        <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s180> ;
    tmk:authorityKind "law" ;
    tmk:authorityStatus tmk:Current ;
    tmk:capturedIn tmk:snapshot-c490a9927f1a ;
    tmk:contentHash "sha256:fbabd8ed2d150ff154fc825c544d47dbff2739fbcf8d78a817ad49c3cc6ffd12" ;
    tmk:ordinal 2 ;
    tmk:text "(2) An application to the Commission for its consent to the assignment of a registered certification trade mark must be in accordance with the regulations." ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMA1995/s180(2)" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s181(2)> a tmk:LegislativeUnit ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/doc/TMA1995> ;
    tmk:authorityKind "law" ;
    tmk:authorityStatus tmk:Current ;
    tmk:capturedIn tmk:snapshot-c490a9927f1a ;
    tmk:contentHash "sha256:a107eab4f9b5c097514561a4ef4cae92eb553c86b34c725dad96e66d60c8aefc" ;
    tmk:text "(2) In addition to its powers under Division 2 of Part 8 in relation to certification trade marks, a prescribed court may, on the application of a person aggrieved, order that the Register be rectified by cancelling the registration of a certification trade mark, or removing or amending an entry in the Register relating to the certification trade mark, on the ground that:" ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMA1995/s181(2)" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s181(6)> a tmk:LegislativeUnit ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/doc/TMA1995> ;
    tmk:authorityKind "law" ;
    tmk:authorityStatus tmk:Current ;
    tmk:capturedIn tmk:snapshot-c490a9927f1a ;
    tmk:contentHash "sha256:12ba549c9fb5c9103583e525c5fa3dc1a9c0c502de8526eee9849ea88f6be694" ;
    tmk:text "(6) A copy of any order made by the court under this section must be given to the Registrar and the Registrar must comply with the order." ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMA1995/s181(6)" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s182(1)> a tmk:LegislativeUnit ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/doc/TMA1995>,
        <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s182> ;
    tmk:authorityKind "law" ;
    tmk:authorityStatus tmk:Current ;
    tmk:capturedIn tmk:snapshot-c490a9927f1a ;
    tmk:contentHash "sha256:5b924d99ed9851ecd870bd4c60c1323943eace86f1cd360dfac022a2c1412800" ;
    tmk:ordinal 1 ;
    tmk:text "(1) A prescribed court may, on the application of a person aggrieved, make such orders as it thinks fit for varying the rules governing the use of a certification trade mark." ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMA1995/s182(1)" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s182(5)> a tmk:LegislativeUnit ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/doc/TMA1995>,
        <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s182> ;
    tmk:authorityKind "law" ;
    tmk:authorityStatus tmk:Current ;
    tmk:capturedIn tmk:snapshot-c490a9927f1a ;
    tmk:contentHash "sha256:550a588fbae26f14bc320cbc62670152a909746a383ff28cc4e5555ed515abcc" ;
    tmk:ordinal 6 ;
    tmk:text "(5) If the court orders that the rules are to be varied, the registered owner of the certification trade mark must give to the Registrar a copy of the rules as varied that is certified by the Commission to be a true copy." ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMA1995/s182(5)" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s187(c)> a tmk:LegislativeUnit ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/doc/TMA1995>,
        <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s187> ;
    tmk:authorityKind "law" ;
    tmk:authorityStatus tmk:Current ;
    tmk:capturedIn tmk:snapshot-c490a9927f1a ;
    tmk:contentHash "sha256:88c55e7055ca1e57b0105a647a750d7fab70f0d5293f49d2cbfb311a03e7c173" ;
    tmk:ordinal 5 ;
    tmk:text "(c) if the trade mark is not registered as a trade mark in the name of the applicant; or" ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMA1995/s187(c)" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s187(d)> a tmk:LegislativeUnit ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/doc/TMA1995>,
        <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s187> ;
    tmk:authorityKind "law" ;
    tmk:authorityStatus tmk:Current ;
    tmk:capturedIn tmk:snapshot-c490a9927f1a ;
    tmk:contentHash "sha256:5aefbba65af54a65141993e81bc587086f99cdc1a80b5e57e6c7bd5159b8b643" ;
    tmk:ordinal 6 ;
    tmk:text "(d) in the case of a registered trade mark—if it is not likely that the use of the trade mark in relation to the goods or services in respect of which its registration as a defensive trade mark is sought will be taken to indicate that there is a connection between those goods or services and the registered owner." ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMA1995/s187(d)" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s19(1)> a tmk:LegislativeUnit ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/doc/TMA1995>,
        <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s19> ;
    tmk:authorityKind "law" ;
    tmk:authorityStatus tmk:Current ;
    tmk:capturedIn tmk:snapshot-c490a9927f1a ;
    tmk:contentHash "sha256:8172881693dca61e6ff3a61fa92780d3175823d42855b61a53ee1f48b826359a" ;
    tmk:ordinal 1 ;
    tmk:text "(1) A trade mark may be registered in accordance with this Act in respect of:" ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMA1995/s19(1)" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s20(1)> a tmk:LegislativeUnit ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/doc/TMA1995>,
        <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s20> ;
    tmk:authorityKind "law" ;
    tmk:authorityStatus tmk:Current ;
    tmk:capturedIn tmk:snapshot-c490a9927f1a ;
    tmk:contentHash "sha256:3418420d73bfd8173a75068689fd325dc8492136b35fdc9ef45cb71eb7d68c46" ;
    tmk:ordinal 1 ;
    tmk:text "(1) If a trade mark is registered, the registered owner of the trade mark has, subject to this Part, the exclusive rights:" ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMA1995/s20(1)" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s20(3)> a tmk:LegislativeUnit ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/doc/TMA1995>,
        <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s20> ;
    tmk:authorityKind "law" ;
    tmk:authorityStatus tmk:Current ;
    tmk:capturedIn tmk:snapshot-c490a9927f1a ;
    tmk:contentHash "sha256:dd5561052b1ed875eef830d2db5d70f5d81a07a7c5574d36724bd081db9a1b5e" ;
    tmk:ordinal 10 ;
    tmk:text "(3) The rights are taken to have accrued to the registered owner as from the date of registration of the trade mark." ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMA1995/s20(3)" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s20(4)> a tmk:LegislativeUnit ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/doc/TMA1995>,
        <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s20> ;
    tmk:authorityKind "law" ;
    tmk:authorityStatus tmk:Current ;
    tmk:capturedIn tmk:snapshot-c490a9927f1a ;
    tmk:contentHash "sha256:09b0f1472d7ba494956af12e7d55b9a733286f7a7f966908f3a6c53ccd839b6a" ;
    tmk:ordinal 12 ;
    tmk:text "(4) If the trade mark is registered subject to conditions or limitations, the rights of the registered owner are restricted by those conditions or limitations." ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMA1995/s20(4)" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s20(5)> a tmk:LegislativeUnit ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/doc/TMA1995>,
        <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s20> ;
    tmk:authorityKind "law" ;
    tmk:authorityStatus tmk:Current ;
    tmk:capturedIn tmk:snapshot-c490a9927f1a ;
    tmk:contentHash "sha256:d2de326e8809f552b973219391baf5f97c5de32560528a6bb6fc82a8ef1afcab" ;
    tmk:ordinal 14 ;
    tmk:text "(5) If the trade mark is registered in the name of 2 or more persons as joint owners of the trade mark, the rights granted to those persons under this section are to be exercised by them as if they were the rights of a single person." ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMA1995/s20(5)" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s202(b)> a tmk:LegislativeUnit ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/doc/TMA1995>,
        <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s202> ;
    tmk:authorityKind "law" ;
    tmk:authorityStatus tmk:Current ;
    tmk:capturedIn tmk:snapshot-c490a9927f1a ;
    tmk:contentHash "sha256:20620f11d490b5cd841da39cbf6c943cb4cd2b3df0decf8ee97c6bc252c2cc31" ;
    tmk:ordinal 3 ;
    tmk:text "(b) receive written or oral evidence on oath or affirmation; and" ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMA1995/s202(b)" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s202(d)> a tmk:LegislativeUnit ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/doc/TMA1995>,
        <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s202> ;
    tmk:authorityKind "law" ;
    tmk:authorityStatus tmk:Current ;
    tmk:capturedIn tmk:snapshot-c490a9927f1a ;
    tmk:contentHash "sha256:9a6434cc380fb41e550659c6ee752ac4c2e973605a01b64dc61e7224d244ad1a" ;
    tmk:ordinal 5 ;
    tmk:text "(d) award costs against a party to proceedings brought before the Registrar; and" ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMA1995/s202(d)" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s21(1)> a tmk:LegislativeUnit ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/doc/TMA1995>,
        <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s21> ;
    tmk:authorityKind "law" ;
    tmk:authorityStatus tmk:Current ;
    tmk:capturedIn tmk:snapshot-c490a9927f1a ;
    tmk:contentHash "sha256:72bb10cb46e5f12d90713b47950a40b5f9060e1cba7379e69b360a98ea65c6e2" ;
    tmk:ordinal 1 ;
    tmk:text "(1) A registered trade mark is personal property." ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMA1995/s21(1)" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s21(1)(d)> tmk:authorityStatus tmk:NotHeld ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMA1995/s21(1)(d)" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s215(1)(b)> a tmk:LegislativeUnit ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/doc/TMA1995>,
        <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s215> ;
    tmk:authorityKind "law" ;
