    tmk:ordinal 2 ;
    tmk:text "(2) If:" ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMA1995/s63(2)" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s65(2)> a tmk:LegislativeUnit ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/doc/TMA1995>,
        <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s65> ;
    tmk:authorityKind "law" ;
    tmk:authorityStatus tmk:Current ;
    tmk:capturedIn tmk:snapshot-c490a9927f1a ;
    tmk:contentHash "sha256:5e047018dd855fe5672a182c993e0846e03a99efdc54080e90edd65ac8989f9b" ;
    tmk:ordinal 2 ;
    tmk:text "(2) An amendment may be made to the representation of the trade mark if the amendment does not substantially affect the identity of the trade mark as at the time when the particulars of the application were published." ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMA1995/s65(2)" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s65(6)> a tmk:LegislativeUnit ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/doc/TMA1995>,
        <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s65> ;
    tmk:authorityKind "law" ;
    tmk:authorityStatus tmk:Current ;
    tmk:capturedIn tmk:snapshot-c490a9927f1a ;
    tmk:contentHash "sha256:f1d596ce21d81ad204feb5fdcc4368f6165540a3f31e9d0414b755d4bb711949" ;
    tmk:ordinal 6 ;
    tmk:text "(6) An amendment may be made to change the type of registration sought in the application (for example, an application for the registration of a trade mark as a certification trade mark may be amended to an application for registration as a collective trade mark)." ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMA1995/s65(6)" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s65(8)> a tmk:LegislativeUnit ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/doc/TMA1995>,
        <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s65> ;
    tmk:authorityKind "law" ;
    tmk:authorityStatus tmk:Current ;
    tmk:capturedIn tmk:snapshot-c490a9927f1a ;
    tmk:contentHash "sha256:2bf16750cbb02167e07e36795be447de2575e15545fa815718c4b90d7d70d7e9" ;
    tmk:ordinal 8 ;
    tmk:text "(8) Without limiting subsection (7), if the application specifies an applicant without legal personality, an amendment may be made under that subsection to change the reference to the specified applicant to a reference to a person with legal personality if that person can be identified as having made the application." ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMA1995/s65(8)" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s68(1)> a tmk:LegislativeUnit ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/doc/TMA1995>,
        <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s68> ;
    tmk:authorityKind "law" ;
    tmk:authorityStatus tmk:Current ;
    tmk:capturedIn tmk:snapshot-c490a9927f1a ;
    tmk:contentHash "sha256:d02e8167facb374f1a1516c02f710154fb4759135f0a8511868029aeeb92f3ce" ;
    tmk:ordinal 1 ;
    tmk:text "(1) The Registrar must, within the period provided under the regulations, register a trade mark that has been accepted for registration:" ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMA1995/s68(1)" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s69(3)> a tmk:LegislativeUnit ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/doc/TMA1995>,
        <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s69> ;
    tmk:authorityKind "law" ;
    tmk:authorityStatus tmk:Current ;
    tmk:capturedIn tmk:snapshot-c490a9927f1a ;
    tmk:contentHash "sha256:1cc2bd552c2378af331e92a4dd453fc635c7235d9667fb33ce1ea91eb9d10ea7" ;
    tmk:ordinal 10 ;
    tmk:text "(3) If 2 or more persons applied together for the registration of the trade mark (see section 28), the applicants must be registered as joint owners of the trade mark." ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMA1995/s69(3)" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s70(3)> a tmk:LegislativeUnit ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/doc/TMA1995>,
        <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s70> ;
    tmk:authorityKind "law" ;
    tmk:authorityStatus tmk:Current ;
    tmk:capturedIn tmk:snapshot-c490a9927f1a ;
    tmk:contentHash "sha256:3ecdb822cf18c26928394a867357fe5970517779e1221a22505e93be9a67c2a4" ;
    tmk:ordinal 3 ;
    tmk:text "(3) To the extent that a trade mark is registered without limitations as to colour, it is taken to be registered for all colours." ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMA1995/s70(3)" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s72(1)> a tmk:LegislativeUnit ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/doc/TMA1995>,
        <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s72> ;
    tmk:authorityKind "law" ;
    tmk:authorityStatus tmk:Current ;
    tmk:capturedIn tmk:snapshot-c490a9927f1a ;
    tmk:contentHash "sha256:f0a1256af200de89effb5914d68aa5a0df753e060dca11ed4dc83651ed58dbd7" ;
    tmk:ordinal 1 ;
    tmk:text "(1) Subject to subsection (2), the registration of a trade mark in respect of the goods and/or services in respect of which the trade mark is registered is taken to have had effect from (and including) the filing date in respect of the application for registration." ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMA1995/s72(1)" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s72(2)> a tmk:LegislativeUnit ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/doc/TMA1995>,
        <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s72> ;
    tmk:authorityKind "law" ;
    tmk:authorityStatus tmk:Current ;
    tmk:capturedIn tmk:snapshot-c490a9927f1a ;
    tmk:contentHash "sha256:bb666eda17e414110015af87c2dd0c3d78b74fabc581c73458998cde3af0565b" ;
    tmk:ordinal 3 ;
    tmk:text "(2) If:" ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMA1995/s72(2)" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s74(4)> a tmk:LegislativeUnit ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/doc/TMA1995> ;
    tmk:authorityKind "law" ;
    tmk:authorityStatus tmk:Current ;
    tmk:capturedIn tmk:snapshot-c490a9927f1a ;
    tmk:contentHash "sha256:48dc154ae4e480dc846352472551a2d2bd08700a7d692bd4f17a100f8259e7ac" ;
    tmk:text "(4) A disclaimer properly made may not be revoked." ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMA1995/s74(4)" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s8(1)> a tmk:LegislativeUnit ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/doc/TMA1995>,
        <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s8> ;
    tmk:authorityKind "law" ;
    tmk:authorityStatus tmk:Current ;
    tmk:capturedIn tmk:snapshot-c490a9927f1a ;
    tmk:contentHash "sha256:21b440790ccad5fa823dd980170ca3d6eee46d7babe136c1fb1c15d29728b065" ;
    tmk:ordinal 1 ;
    tmk:text "(1) A person is an authorised user of a trade mark if the person uses the trade mark in relation to goods or services under the control of the owner of the trade mark." ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMA1995/s8(1)" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s8(2)> a tmk:LegislativeUnit ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/doc/TMA1995>,
        <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s8> ;
    tmk:authorityKind "law" ;
    tmk:authorityStatus tmk:Current ;
    tmk:capturedIn tmk:snapshot-c490a9927f1a ;
    tmk:contentHash "sha256:5ab774a69addefebfbb76df09ffb19b16415f442fd7e458fe86af94511d4dfce" ;
    tmk:ordinal 2 ;
    tmk:text "(2) The use of a trade mark by an authorised user of the trade mark is an authorised use of the trade mark to the extent only that the user uses the trade mark under the control of the owner of the trade mark." ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMA1995/s8(2)" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s8(3)> a tmk:LegislativeUnit ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/doc/TMA1995>,
        <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s8> ;
    tmk:authorityKind "law" ;
    tmk:authorityStatus tmk:Current ;
    tmk:capturedIn tmk:snapshot-c490a9927f1a ;
    tmk:contentHash "sha256:dfeb8631992dd2cef26b38a617d948d459c19adfbfac72a922978c9a7546a8a0" ;
    tmk:ordinal 3 ;
    tmk:text "(3) If the owner of a trade mark exercises quality control over goods or services:" ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMA1995/s8(3)" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s8(3)(a)> a tmk:LegislativeUnit ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/doc/TMA1995>,
        <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s8> ;
    tmk:authorityKind "law" ;
    tmk:authorityStatus tmk:Current ;
    tmk:capturedIn tmk:snapshot-c490a9927f1a ;
    tmk:contentHash "sha256:4666ccd3d8dce48a71335e805e15f999557bb8c831bc6914cc256431b9b4f8fa" ;
    tmk:ordinal 4 ;
    tmk:text "(a) dealt with or provided in the course of trade by another person; and" ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMA1995/s8(3)(a)" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s8(4)> a tmk:LegislativeUnit ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/doc/TMA1995>,
        <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s8> ;
    tmk:authorityKind "law" ;
    tmk:authorityStatus tmk:Current ;
    tmk:capturedIn tmk:snapshot-c490a9927f1a ;
    tmk:contentHash "sha256:d2f5f49ec1f7330ef64587d901daa8b9a298914abdcef152de24da487e3d3c3f" ;
    tmk:ordinal 7 ;
    tmk:text "(4) If:" ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMA1995/s8(4)" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s8(4)(a)> a tmk:LegislativeUnit ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/doc/TMA1995>,
        <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s8> ;
    tmk:authorityKind "law" ;
    tmk:authorityStatus tmk:Current ;
    tmk:capturedIn tmk:snapshot-c490a9927f1a ;
    tmk:contentHash "sha256:0a46e333f605d04bbfa491e51dc8b58b6e794a59fe6c950d4b43a5ad76d5eb5b" ;
    tmk:ordinal 8 ;
    tmk:text "(a) a person deals with or provides, in the course of trade, goods or services in relation to which a trade mark is used; and" ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMA1995/s8(4)(a)" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s8(5)> a tmk:LegislativeUnit ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/doc/TMA1995>,
        <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s8> ;
    tmk:authorityKind "law" ;
    tmk:authorityStatus tmk:Current ;
    tmk:capturedIn tmk:snapshot-c490a9927f1a ;
    tmk:contentHash "sha256:74a2b35d038ca97c383284f6a4c41fb2b313791929369b988aa70084aef4ea3e" ;
    tmk:ordinal 11 ;
    tmk:text "(5) Subsections (3) and (4) do not limit the meaning of the expression under the control of in subsections (1) and (2)." ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMA1995/s8(5)" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s83(1)> a tmk:LegislativeUnit ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/doc/TMA1995>,
        <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s83> ;
