    tmk:ordinal 26 ;
    tmk:text "(7) The Registrar may take into account a party’s failure to file a summary of submissions under subregulation (6) in making an award of costs." ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMR1995/r5.17(7)" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r5.18(1)> a tmk:LegislativeUnit ;
