    tmk:text "(4) If a request is made under paragraph (2)(b), the Registrar must notify the person whose claim is recorded that:" ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMR1995/r11.3(4)" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r17A.28(2A)> a tmk:LegislativeUnit ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/doc/TMR1995> ;
    tmk:authorityKind "law" ;
    tmk:authorityStatus tmk:Current ;
    tmk:capturedIn tmk:snapshot-c490a9927f1a ;
    tmk:contentHash "sha256:ce7004e47316b9a78007677efb3accc60a8529d9517ee1b522f8ce3ae39eda6b" ;
    tmk:text "(2A) A ground for rejecting an IRDA is that, if the trade mark that is the subject of the IRDA were to become a protected international trade mark, this would result in:" ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMR1995/r17A.28(2A)" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r17A.3> a tmk:LegislativeProvision ;
    rdfs:label "Meaning of priority date"@en-AU ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/doc/TMR1995> ;
    tmk:authorityKind "law" ;
    tmk:authorityStatus tmk:Current ;
    tmk:capturedIn tmk:snapshot-c490a9927f1a ;
    tmk:contentHash "sha256:0c62aac940a5c392b319f95d50944c6423d96e8f7a449c251e99082fd6a0832a" ;
    tmk:text "(1) The priority date for a trade mark that is the subject of an IRDA in respect of particular goods or services is the date that would be the date of effect of the protection of the trade mark in respect of those goods or services if the trade mark became a protected international trade mark. (2) The priority date for a protected international trade mark in respect of particular goods or services is the date of effect of the protection of the trade mark in respect of those goods or services." ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMR1995/r17A.3" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r17A.34A> a tmk:LegislativeProvision ;
    rdfs:label "Filing of statement of grounds and particulars"@en-AU ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/doc/TMR1995> ;
    tmk:authorityKind "law" ;
    tmk:authorityStatus tmk:Current ;
    tmk:capturedIn tmk:snapshot-c490a9927f1a ;
    tmk:contentHash "sha256:0e648da4add4d0a20975096d38179a95771ea1757adde906bd97b0034d4cc01a" ;
    tmk:text "(1) A statement of grounds and particulars must be filed within one month from the day the notice of intention to oppose is filed. (2) The statement must be in an approved form." ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMR1995/r17A.34A" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r17A.34D(2)> a tmk:LegislativeUnit ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/doc/TMR1995>,
        <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r17A.34D> ;
    tmk:authorityKind "law" ;
    tmk:authorityStatus tmk:Current ;
    tmk:capturedIn tmk:snapshot-c490a9927f1a ;
    tmk:contentHash "sha256:8b57622576fdc01366129ac2ce5d2de5396e4c4483b04e737c4c251074d9f7b5" ;
    tmk:ordinal 2 ;
    tmk:text "(2) However, if the request is made after the period for filing the notice or statement of grounds and particulars has ended, the Registrar must not grant the extension unless the Registrar is satisfied that there is sufficient reason for the delay in making the request." ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMR1995/r17A.34D(2)" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r17A.34H(2)> a tmk:LegislativeUnit ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/doc/TMR1995>,
        <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r17A.34H> ;
    tmk:authorityKind "law" ;
    tmk:authorityStatus tmk:Current ;
    tmk:capturedIn tmk:snapshot-c490a9927f1a ;
    tmk:contentHash "sha256:3c31fe9864af35dc5ad60c0fd4318233d20b0bc8c5ffe8b53e998fdb3aa376ed" ;
    tmk:ordinal 2 ;
    tmk:text "(2) The holder must file an Australian or New Zealand address for service with the notice." ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMR1995/r17A.34H(2)" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r17A.34H(5)> a tmk:LegislativeUnit ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/doc/TMR1995>,
        <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r17A.34H> ;
    tmk:authorityKind "law" ;
    tmk:authorityStatus tmk:Current ;
    tmk:capturedIn tmk:snapshot-c490a9927f1a ;
    tmk:contentHash "sha256:99b0d3ba1471c626d775ff22aca60e9ad123e73b7a6fc6ef51cd8da120a01ebf" ;
    tmk:ordinal 7 ;
    tmk:text "(5) The Registrar is not required to take any action in response to a notice of intention to defend filed under subregulation (1) unless the holder has notified the Registrar, in writing, of the holder’s address for service in Australia or New Zealand." ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMR1995/r17A.34H(5)" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r17A.34L(2)> a tmk:LegislativeUnit ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/doc/TMR1995> ;
    tmk:authorityKind "law" ;
    tmk:authorityStatus tmk:Current ;
    tmk:capturedIn tmk:snapshot-c490a9927f1a ;
    tmk:contentHash "sha256:697b65568c9b58a1f59199a162d2019566ea521b1af7537a08f1f312f5937475" ;
    tmk:text "(2) If the Registrar is satisfied that the parties agree to a coolingoff period, the Registrar must allow a coolingoff period of 6 months." ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMR1995/r17A.34L(2)" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r17A.48E> a tmk:LegislativeProvision ;
    rdfs:label "Notification of application"@en-AU ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/doc/TMR1995> ;
    tmk:authorityKind "law" ;
    tmk:authorityStatus tmk:Current ;
    tmk:capturedIn tmk:snapshot-c490a9927f1a ;
    tmk:contentHash "sha256:f0e12119d10aa49f3fbc26820399e25684c26090f9be2c47a855bc39597a86dd" ;
    tmk:text "(1) For subsection 95(1) of the Act, the Registrar must, within one month from the filing of the application, give a copy of the application to each person who, in the Registrar’s opinion, should receive one. (2) For the purposes of subsections 95(2) and (3) of the Act, the application must be published in a computer database maintained by the Trade Marks Office." ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMR1995/r17A.48E" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r17A.48M(2)> a tmk:LegislativeUnit ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/doc/TMR1995>,
        <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r17A.48M> ;
    tmk:authorityKind "law" ;
    tmk:authorityStatus tmk:Current ;
    tmk:capturedIn tmk:snapshot-c490a9927f1a ;
    tmk:contentHash "sha256:8b57622576fdc01366129ac2ce5d2de5396e4c4483b04e737c4c251074d9f7b5" ;
    tmk:ordinal 2 ;
    tmk:text "(2) However, if the request is made after the period for filing the notice or statement of grounds and particulars has ended, the Registrar must not grant the extension unless the Registrar is satisfied that there is sufficient reason for the delay in making the request." ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMR1995/r17A.48M(2)" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r17A.48U(2)> a tmk:LegislativeUnit ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/doc/TMR1995> ;
    tmk:authorityKind "law" ;
    tmk:authorityStatus tmk:Current ;
    tmk:capturedIn tmk:snapshot-c490a9927f1a ;
    tmk:contentHash "sha256:697b65568c9b58a1f59199a162d2019566ea521b1af7537a08f1f312f5937475" ;
    tmk:text "(2) If the Registrar is satisfied that the parties agree to a coolingoff period, the Registrar must allow a coolingoff period of 6 months." ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMR1995/r17A.48U(2)" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r17A.56> a tmk:LegislativeProvision ;
    rdfs:label "Application of Division"@en-AU ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/doc/TMR1995> ;
    tmk:authorityKind "law" ;
    tmk:authorityStatus tmk:Current ;
    tmk:capturedIn tmk:snapshot-c490a9927f1a ;
    tmk:contentHash "sha256:4aa72d89513f875718466604e0be802f73fb44183252bdc34828576de75e88d0" ;
    tmk:text "This Division applies if the Registrar receives notification from the International Bureau of a change of ownership of the international registration of a trade mark that is the subject of an IRDA or is a protected international trade mark. Note: Change of ownership is defined in regulation 17A.2 to include assignment or transmission." ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMR1995/r17A.56" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r21.20B> a tmk:LegislativeProvision ;
    rdfs:label "Notice of opposition"@en-AU ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/doc/TMR1995> ;
    tmk:authorityKind "law" ;
    tmk:authorityStatus tmk:Current ;
    tmk:capturedIn tmk:snapshot-c490a9927f1a ;
    tmk:contentHash "sha256:c6e25c284f8da9e268d92715f6a031b58bf74e870985bc093aac762c19973190" ;
    tmk:text "(1) For subsection 224(6) of the Act, a person may oppose a request for an extension of time by filing a notice of opposition in an approved form within one month from the publication of the request for the extension in a computer database maintained by the Trade Marks Office under regulation 21.20AA. (2) The Registrar must give a copy of the notice to the applicant." ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMR1995/r21.20B" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r4.12(1)> a tmk:LegislativeUnit ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/doc/TMR1995>,
        <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r4.12> ;
    tmk:authorityKind "law" ;
    tmk:authorityStatus tmk:Current ;
    tmk:capturedIn tmk:snapshot-c490a9927f1a ;
    tmk:contentHash "sha256:bf27d8157d4b05b05818e9f16532728f9d7adee114bcf613c9f77f30516c67e0" ;
    tmk:ordinal 1 ;
    tmk:text "(1) For the purposes of subsection 37(1) of the Act (which deals with lapsing), the prescribed period, for an application in respect of which a report is made under regulation 4.8, is:" ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMR1995/r4.12(1)" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r4.13(1)(c)(i)> a tmk:LegislativeUnit ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/doc/TMR1995>,
        <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r4.13> ;
    tmk:authorityKind "law" ;
    tmk:authorityStatus tmk:Current ;
    tmk:capturedIn tmk:snapshot-c490a9927f1a ;
    tmk:contentHash "sha256:4ea45b2c08ea77b7ae59cfaf95b9b447e07197645c3a9773e254f3873763bbf4" ;
    tmk:ordinal 8 ;
    tmk:text "(i) is awaiting the finalisation of proceedings in respect of the application for registration of the other trade mark or the IRDA; or" ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMR1995/r4.13(1)(c)(i)" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r4.13(1)(c)(ii)> a tmk:LegislativeUnit ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/doc/TMR1995>,
        <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r4.13> ;
    tmk:authorityKind "law" ;
    tmk:authorityStatus tmk:Current ;
    tmk:capturedIn tmk:snapshot-c490a9927f1a ;
    tmk:contentHash "sha256:8ef47c813438fbb47281bcd3439811d7b86e22be32eb051559af8c01b41a346d" ;
    tmk:ordinal 9 ;
    tmk:text "(ii) is seeking to satisfy the Registrar as to:" ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMR1995/r4.13(1)(c)(ii)" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r4.13(1)(c)(v)> a tmk:LegislativeUnit ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/doc/TMR1995>,
        <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r4.13> ;
    tmk:authorityKind "law" ;
    tmk:authorityStatus tmk:Current ;
    tmk:capturedIn tmk:snapshot-c490a9927f1a ;
    tmk:contentHash "sha256:716ec09e6a1383f3368a78a870147deee19ee03999078fcecc0c1bd900c558d7" ;
    tmk:ordinal 15 ;
    tmk:text "(v) is awaiting renewal of the registration of the other trade mark in the period of 6 months after registration of the other trade mark has expired, or removal of the other trade mark from the Register; or" ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMR1995/r4.13(1)(c)(v)" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r4.13(2)(b)> a tmk:LegislativeUnit ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/doc/TMR1995>,
        <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r4.13> ;
    tmk:authorityKind "law" ;
    tmk:authorityStatus tmk:Current ;
    tmk:capturedIn tmk:snapshot-c490a9927f1a ;
    tmk:contentHash "sha256:721bf1ba6a3845b7528055095b9cc2d89eaec568ed1570ec2c012ec501a6428c" ;
    tmk:ordinal 19 ;
    tmk:text "(b) appeal proceedings under a provision of the Act have begun in a prescribed court in relation to the application; or" ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMR1995/r4.13(2)(b)" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r4.15(c)> a tmk:LegislativeUnit ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/doc/TMR1995>,
        <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r4.15> ;
    tmk:authorityKind "law" ;
    tmk:authorityStatus tmk:Current ;
    tmk:capturedIn tmk:snapshot-c490a9927f1a ;
    tmk:contentHash "sha256:04ebad61efbe841139acb34439d3ba1719c6b4faf3ad076d721f68e058bfbce4" ;
    tmk:ordinal 4 ;
    tmk:text "(c) a representation of the Arms, or of a flag or seal, of the Commonwealth or of a State or Territory;" ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMR1995/r4.15(c)" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r4.15(da)> a tmk:LegislativeUnit ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/doc/TMR1995>,
        <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r4.15> ;
    tmk:authorityKind "law" ;
    tmk:authorityStatus tmk:Current ;
    tmk:capturedIn tmk:snapshot-c490a9927f1a ;
    tmk:contentHash "sha256:9a7d0944edad3bbbd3d76292833a5b60bc2de8ae35f7a6fc3010e18f490548d7" ;
    tmk:ordinal 6 ;
    tmk:text "(da) a representation of a flag of a country that is a member of the International Union for the Protection of Industrial Property;" ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMR1995/r4.15(da)" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r4.8(3)> a tmk:LegislativeUnit ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/doc/TMR1995>,
        <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r4.8> ;
    tmk:authorityKind "law" ;
    tmk:authorityStatus tmk:Current ;
    tmk:capturedIn tmk:snapshot-c490a9927f1a ;
    tmk:contentHash "sha256:2239ef5a2860a543b8417bf515ce16c57b0e333659612d7873805dd7e501224a" ;
    tmk:ordinal 6 ;
    tmk:text "(3) If the Registrar reasonably suspects that the provisions of paragraph 27(1)(b) of the Act do not apply in relation to all of the goods and/or services specified in an application for registration of a trade mark, the Registrar may require the applicant to make a declaration to the Registrar that those provisions apply to all of those goods and/or services." ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMR1995/r4.8(3)" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r5.10(2)> a tmk:LegislativeUnit ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/doc/TMR1995>,
        <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r5.10> ;
    tmk:authorityKind "law" ;
    tmk:authorityStatus tmk:Current ;
    tmk:capturedIn tmk:snapshot-c490a9927f1a ;
    tmk:contentHash "sha256:8b57622576fdc01366129ac2ce5d2de5396e4c4483b04e737c4c251074d9f7b5" ;
    tmk:ordinal 2 ;
    tmk:text "(2) However, if the request is made after the period for filing the notice or statement of grounds and particulars has ended, the Registrar must not grant the extension unless the Registrar is satisfied that there is sufficient reason for the delay in making the request." ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMR1995/r5.10(2)" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r5.13> a tmk:LegislativeProvision ;
    rdfs:label "Filing of notice of intention to defend"@en-AU ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/doc/TMR1995> ;
    tmk:authorityKind "law" ;
    tmk:authorityStatus tmk:Current ;
    tmk:capturedIn tmk:snapshot-c490a9927f1a ;
    tmk:contentHash "sha256:ea98623007f66c4c521fe10729e46b129188f138651798e784404ddb58dc0a58" ;
    tmk:text "(1) For subsection 52A(2) of the Act, a notice of intention to defend must be filed within 2 months from the day the applicant is given a copy of the statement of grounds and particulars. (2) The Registrar must give a copy of the notice to the opponent." ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMR1995/r5.13" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r5.16(2)> a tmk:LegislativeUnit ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/doc/TMR1995>,
        <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r5.16> ;
    tmk:authorityKind "law" ;
    tmk:authorityStatus tmk:Current ;
    tmk:capturedIn tmk:snapshot-c490a9927f1a ;
    tmk:contentHash "sha256:697b65568c9b58a1f59199a162d2019566ea521b1af7537a08f1f312f5937475" ;
    tmk:ordinal 5 ;
    tmk:text "(2) If the Registrar is satisfied that the parties agree to a coolingoff period, the Registrar must allow a coolingoff period of 6 months." ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMR1995/r5.16(2)" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r5.8(2)> a tmk:LegislativeUnit ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/doc/TMR1995>,
        <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r5.8> ;
    tmk:authorityKind "law" ;
    tmk:authorityStatus tmk:Current ;
    tmk:capturedIn tmk:snapshot-c490a9927f1a ;
    tmk:contentHash "sha256:3db5ca4e556e08658d6de26d9cb49467220e67019f4a32d794fe07cabdfce001" ;
    tmk:ordinal 2 ;
    tmk:text "(2) If the Registrar decides that the statement is adequate, the Registrar must give a copy of the statement to the applicant." ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMR1995/r5.8(2)" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r6.6> a tmk:LegislativeProvision ;
    rdfs:label "Notice of opposition"@en-AU ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/doc/TMR1995> ;
    tmk:authorityKind "law" ;
    tmk:authorityStatus tmk:Current ;
    tmk:capturedIn tmk:snapshot-c490a9927f1a ;
    tmk:contentHash "sha256:edabfcc9eca111b5892a2de0ea473a4f292408937541e1afa68a768d2684c818" ;
    tmk:text "(1) For subsection 65A(4) of the Act, a person may oppose a request for amendment by filing a notice of opposition, in an approved form, within one month from the publication of the request for the amendment in a computer database maintained by the Trade Marks Office in accordance with regulation 6.3A. (2) The Registrar must give a copy of the notice to the applicant." ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMR1995/r6.6" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r9.12(2)> a tmk:LegislativeUnit ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/doc/TMR1995>,
        <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r9.12> ;
    tmk:authorityKind "law" ;
    tmk:authorityStatus tmk:Current ;
    tmk:capturedIn tmk:snapshot-c490a9927f1a ;
    tmk:contentHash "sha256:8b57622576fdc01366129ac2ce5d2de5396e4c4483b04e737c4c251074d9f7b5" ;
    tmk:ordinal 2 ;
    tmk:text "(2) However, if the request is made after the period for filing the notice or statement of grounds and particulars has ended, the Registrar must not grant the extension unless the Registrar is satisfied that there is sufficient reason for the delay in making the request." ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMR1995/r9.12(2)" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r9.19(2)> a tmk:LegislativeUnit ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/doc/TMR1995> ;
    tmk:authorityKind "law" ;
    tmk:authorityStatus tmk:Current ;
    tmk:capturedIn tmk:snapshot-c490a9927f1a ;
    tmk:contentHash "sha256:697b65568c9b58a1f59199a162d2019566ea521b1af7537a08f1f312f5937475" ;
    tmk:text "(2) If the Registrar is satisfied that the parties agree to a coolingoff period, the Registrar must allow a coolingoff period of 6 months." ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMR1995/r9.19(2)" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r9.6> a tmk:LegislativeProvision ;
    rdfs:label "Notification of application"@en-AU ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/doc/TMR1995> ;
    tmk:authorityKind "law" ;
    tmk:authorityStatus tmk:Current ;
    tmk:capturedIn tmk:snapshot-c490a9927f1a ;
    tmk:contentHash "sha256:f0e12119d10aa49f3fbc26820399e25684c26090f9be2c47a855bc39597a86dd" ;
    tmk:text "(1) For subsection 95(1) of the Act, the Registrar must, within one month from the filing of the application, give a copy of the application to each person who, in the Registrar’s opinion, should receive one. (2) For the purposes of subsections 95(2) and (3) of the Act, the application must be published in a computer database maintained by the Trade Marks Office." ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMR1995/r9.6" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s10> a tmk:LegislativeProvision ;
    rdfs:label "Definition of deceptively similar"@en-AU ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/doc/TMA1995> ;
    tmk:authorityKind "law" ;
    tmk:authorityStatus tmk:Current ;
    tmk:capturedIn tmk:snapshot-c490a9927f1a ;
    tmk:contentHash "sha256:267b10f0b047e6ab3212296943282612992e1bf8ca8de41a26b0891eefaa166e" ;
    tmk:text "For the purposes of this Act, a trade mark is taken to be deceptively similar to another trade mark if it so nearly resembles that other trade mark that it is likely to deceive or cause confusion." ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMA1995/s10" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s161> a tmk:LegislativeProvision ;
    rdfs:label "Object of Part"@en-AU ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/doc/TMA1995> ;
    tmk:authorityKind "law" ;
    tmk:authorityStatus tmk:Current ;
    tmk:capturedIn tmk:snapshot-c490a9927f1a ;
    tmk:contentHash "sha256:37189a4f649431825c213cf95be8d1f75121e42661496c20df92e04c633ffa73" ;
    tmk:text "This Part: (a) defines a collective trade mark; and (b) provides to what extent, and subject to what modifications or additions, the provisions of this Act relating to trade marks apply to collective trade marks." ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMA1995/s161" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s171> a tmk:LegislativeProvision ;
    rdfs:label "Rights given by registration of a certification trade mark"@en-AU ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/doc/TMA1995> ;
